/S /P
/P 442 0 R
/E (The proposed system is a web-based Expense Tracker System designed to provide an efficient, and user-friendly solution for organizational finances. The system automates the process of recording income and expenses, eliminating the limitations of manual bookkeeping. )
/Pg 74 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
1742 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 442 0 R
/E (The existing expense management systems mainly rely on manual bookkeeping, paper-based records, Excel spreadsheets, and basic accounting software. These methods require continuous manual data entry, making the process time-consuming and inefficient. Due to human involvement, there is a high possibility of errors and inaccurate records. Most traditional systems do not provide real-time updates, which limits effective expense tracking. )
/Pg 74 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
1743 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 442 0 R
/E (The main objective of this project is to develop a secure web-based expense tracking system for efficient financial management. The system allows users to record their expenses in real time with ease. It categorizes expenses to help users analyze their spending patterns effectively. Graphical dashboards are provided to visualize expense data clearly. Secure authentication mechanisms are implemented to protect user data. )
/Pg 74 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
