/P 446 0 R
/E (The Expense Tracker System developed using the MERN stack successfully addresses the need for an efficient, secure, and user-friendly solution for managing personal expenses. The system replaces traditional manual and spreadsheet-based methods with a modern web- based application that enables users to record and monitor expenses in real time. By providing categorized expense tracking and graphical dashboards, the system helps users clearly understand their spending patterns and financial behavior. )
/Pg 78 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
