/E (Another important enhancement is the incorporation of advanced analytics and AI-based expense prediction. By analyzing historical expense data, the system can provide insights into future spending patterns and suggest better budgeting strategies. Such intelligent features can significantly improve financial planning and decision-making. Additionally, support for multi- currency transactions can be added to make the system suitable for users who deal with international expenses. )
/Pg 79 0 R
/K [2]
