/P 447 0 R
/E (Overall, these future enhancements will make the Expense Tracker System more intelligent, flexible, and user-centric. With continuous improvements and the adoption of emerging technologies, the system can evolve into a comprehensive financial management platform capable of meeting diverse user needs.In addition to the proposed enhancements, the system can be further improved by incorporating role-based access control, which would be useful if the application is extended for organizational or family use. This feature would allow multiple users to access the system with different permissions, such as administrators and regular users. Moreover, adding data visualization enhancements like interactive graphs, trend analysis, and comparative reports across months or years would provide deeper insights into spending behavior. )
/Pg 79 0 R
/K [4]
>>
